cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "spine-mr-finngen: Mendelian randomization pipeline for immune traits and spine-specific osteomyelitis"
abstract: >-
  Pure-Python two-sample Mendelian randomization pipeline linking genetically
  predicted immune and cytokine traits (EBI GWAS Catalog) to five FinnGen R11
  osteomyelitis phenotypes, four of them spine-specific.
authors:
